      "Language": "ukr",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The results of examination and treatment of 17 patients for relaxation of the diaphragm were analyzed. There was proved the efficacy of application of the biological tissues welding while operative treatment of patients, using a duplicature method. While the biological welding application a reduction of the intervention total duration time was noted, and of intraoperative blood loss - by 17%, and a need for analgetic preparations - in 1.3 times. Minimal irritation impact of biological welding on parietal pleura and the pain intensity reduction was established."},
